<title>USA: Fed says overnight system RPs totaled $4.460 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system RPs totaled $4.460 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added $4.460 billion to the banking system on Thursday via overnight system repurchase agreements, the New York Fed confirmed.</p>
<p>(( --N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1869 ))</p>
